  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a771745b-87cb-467f-ac6d-05f040e58a20"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "draws 8 bounces."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"18f34aca-9737-49f1-84be-c360f7768e60"],

Cell["\<\
Experimental: figure. The figure's layout and options may change.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"e8454688-1ed1-4d6d-87ad-c3c5c3e4f1af"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Definition: the observer of velocity ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " (red) carries a mirror on the parallel worldline (faint red) at the \
Euclidean distance ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<ClockLength\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0711ca7f-044a-4898-9d2a-5ca9a7157001"],
 " along ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["WorldlineNormal"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraCausality/ref/WorldlineNormal", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraCausality Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["\[CurlyPhi]", "TR"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5af88174-7533-4c10-a397-4ae2baac264b"],
 ". Light leaves the observer at arc length ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<StartArcLength\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4284b1c4-7eb4-4715-93a1-57a50322ac19"],
 ", runs along ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["LightDirection"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraCausality/ref/LightDirection", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraCausality Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[CurlyPhi]", "TR"], ",", " ", 
    ButtonBox["True",
     BaseStyle->"Link"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ea8a5e17-f19a-4741-866e-ffa212b45bfc"],
 " to the mirror and back along ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["LightDirection"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraCausality/ref/LightDirection", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraCausality Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[CurlyPhi]", "TR"], ",", " ", 
    ButtonBox["False",
     BaseStyle->"Link"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ade98f57-7a2e-4cb5-85dc-60cda3c60fdc"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 " segments in all; each return to the observer (purple) is one tick. Because \
the two worldlines are parallel, every round trip is the same translate along \
the worldline, so the ticks are equally spaced in the observer's proper time; \
the rest observer (faint blue) sees the period \[Gamma] times longer in radar \
time. At ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " = 0 the figure is the clock at rest."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"00f29baa-e852-47be-97f9-3609839cd9c4"],

